    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to :",
